    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-oldenborn-furrykin=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>\"You put on a story, and the world agrees.\"</em></p><p><strong>Sovereign Mask (1/Soma Break).</strong> Over 1 minute, assume a mythic persona (King, Trickster, Saint, Monster, etc.). For 10 minutes, gain a skill rank in Diplomacy (Presence), Stealth (Intrigue), and Intimidation (Presence) — or mastery if already proficient. You cannot be magically identified or scryed while masked.</p>\n<div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"oldLumenSovereignMask\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Sovereign Mask</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> 1-minute donning &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Assume mythic persona for 10 min: +1 rank Diplomacy/Stealth/Intimidation (mastery if proficient); immune to magical identification/scrying.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
